OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 24 FEB
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GSoweto is joined once again by
OL,12,     Ghis guest this week, Aaron Parks,
OL,13,     Gwho has another album to share
OL,14,     Gthat has inspired him.
OL,15,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,16,     GViolinist Julia Fischer joins the
OL,17,     GWDR Symphony Orchestra and
OL,18,     Gconductor Cristian Macelaru in
OL,19,     GBrahms' Violin Concerto and the
OL,20,     Gorchestra follows with
OL,21,     GShostakovich's 10th Symphony.
